{
	"nodes":[
		{"id":"in","type":"text","text":"## draft reply\nThe raw reply of the drafter.\nfrom: draft step, `errorStrategy: 'warn'`","x":0,"y":0,"width":260,"height":140,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"dec","type":"text","text":"## `plan.decode`\nRuns `plan.schema.safeParse`.\nNot ok: extra key, missing field, bad value\n(`scorers.closed_output`)","x":340,"y":0,"width":280,"height":160,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"code","type":"text","text":"## code scorers\nOne for each shape rule and code check.\nFree, no model.\nNo evidence or a throw: cannot verify","x":700,"y":0,"width":280,"height":160,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"gate","type":"text","text":"## all strict code checks pass?","x":1060,"y":20,"width":220,"height":110,"color":"2"},
		{"id":"skip","type":"text","text":"## `skippedJudges`\nEach judgement rule gets cannot verify.\nNo model call.","x":1060,"y":220,"width":260,"height":140,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"judge","type":"text","text":"## judge scorers\n`plan.scorers.judges(model)`\nOne call answers one rule, for many items.\nyes / no / unknown\nModel from another provider than the drafter\nQuote not in a source: cannot verify (`judge.quote_verified`)","x":1360,"y":0,"width":320,"height":230,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"rows","type":"text","text":"## `VerdictRow`s\nOne for each item and each rule.\nrule id, version, hash, binding,\nverdict, decider, reason, evidence","x":1760,"y":0,"width":300,"height":170,"color":"3"},
		{"id":"bind","type":"text","text":"## bindings: `judgeDraft` outcome\n`strict` fail or failed decode: repair (first)\n`strict` cannot verify: person\n`soft`: keep output, add a warning\n`watch`: log only\n(`judge.bindings`)","x":2140,"y":0,"width":280,"height":220,"color":"2"},
		{"id":"rep","type":"text","text":"## repair round\nAll errors in one round, with the fix.\nBudget: 3 rounds (`.dountil`).","x":2500,"y":-160,"width":280,"height":140,"color":"1"},
		{"id":"per","type":"text","text":"## person step\nBudget spent, or a strict rule cannot be verified.\nWorkflow suspends.","x":2500,"y":40,"width":280,"height":150,"color":"1"},
		{"id":"acc","type":"text","text":"## assimilate\n`acceptOutput` + `writeVerdicts`\nOnly when each strict rule passes.","x":2500,"y":240,"width":280,"height":140,"color":"3"},
		{"id":"note","type":"text","text":"Spec: [judge-step.md](../design/judge-step.md) (`judge.order`, `judge.bindings`)\n[rule-enforcement.md](../design/rule-enforcement.md) (`enforce.binding`, `enforce.deciders`)\n[compiler.md](../design/compiler.md) (`compile.scorers`)\nUnit: `plan.judge_step`, spec of 2026-11-07, not built yet.","x":0,"y":260,"width":420,"height":130,"color":"6"}
	],
